 "_status": "RELEASED wave by wave (R-C9-280 first burst; R-C9-281 wave 1 = 0_3). Each wave is run by fid/pt/tools/ph3_prepare.sh wave <keys> (the frozen driver's per-chunk steps, one wave only) and stops for the conductor's QA.",
